~ start
Az laugh: [font_size=70]Fenn!! [wave freq=7 amp=30]You did it![/wave][/font_size]
Fenn: Are you guys okay?
Az: We're good. Few scratches, nothing bad.
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]Oh [i]Post...[/i] I can not [shake level=7 rate=30]believeth[/shake] I-[wait=0.3] [i]ugh...[/i][/font_size]
Fenn worry: What's wrong?
Winston grit: [font_size=70]I'm the WORST![/font_size] [font_size=50]Tis what's wrong.[/font_size] [font_size=60]I am a [shake level=7 rate=30][i]failure,[/i][/shake] Fenn. [/font_size][font_size=40]I hath failed.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: What? What are you talking about?
Winston grit: [speed=1.2]I can't do [i]anything[/i] right. I hath tried [i]ambushing thee[/i]. I threweth [i]minions[/i] thy way.
Winston grit: [speed=1.2][font_size=60]I hath even [shake level=10 rate=40][i]cloned[/i] myself[/shake], something I knoweth [i]VERY[/i] well, and nothing worked.
Winston: [speed=0.5][font_size=30]Tis broken. Tis all broken.[/font_size]
Winston: [speed=0.7][font_size=40]I do not hath anything left. Thou hast won. Congratulations, Fenn.[/font_size]
Fenn worry: Wh- [wait=0.3] why are you being so mean?
Winston awkward: [font_size=40]What?[/font_size]
Fenn: You're being really mean to yourself. [wave freq=7 amp=30]I had fun today![/wave] I think that's more important.
Winston: Y- [wait=0.3]you did?
Fenn starry: It was fun! [wait=0.3]Right, [color="B80006"]Az[/color]?
Az: I mean,[wait=0.3] your creations were pretty cool.
Winston: Wait... really?
Az laugh: Yeah. And my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color] looked even [i]cleaner[/i] than usual.
Winston awkward: Well, [wait=0.3]twas kind of a low bar...
Az laugh: HAH, [wait=0.3]yeah, [wait=0.3]you right.
Az: You managed to make [i]all that[/i] with the scraps I had lying around?
Winston awkward: Oh-[wait=0.3] I am sorry! [wait=0.3]I can return thy parts!
Az: Nah man, it's all good. It's only fair. You kinda saved me with the inhaler.
Winston awkward: Oh,[wait=0.3] well, yeah. I saweth a few in thy [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]. 
Winston awkward: I didn't- [wait=0.3][font_size=40]I mean- [wait=0.3]I didn't wanteth thee to- [/font_size][font_size=30][wait=0.3]to die.[/font_size]
Az annoy: Hey, at least you [i]DID[/i] something today. [shake level=7 rate=30]I just sat around and waited for Fenn.[/shake]
Fenn worry: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]That's not true! I had your bangle.[/shake][/font_size]
Fenn starry: [wave freq=7 amp=30]I couldn't have gotten around without it![/wave]
Winston awkward: And those bangles art,[wait=0.3] liketh,[wait=0.3] [i]super cool.[/i]
Winston: And t-thou also saved me from... uh.... from I- Iceton. So... thanks.
Az: Eh... you should be thanking Fenn. He convinced me to get over myself and help you.
Fenn starry: Yeah! If you died, who else would make cool icy things?
Winston: Hah... I do not knoweth... I suppose
Winston awkward: Art we... art we good?
Az: Yeah. Help me free my Baba, and we're good.
Winston awkward: Ah, of course.
Fade to black, fade back in with characters in front of the door seal
Winston raises his hand, magical particles appear, and then the glowing ice symbol stops glowing on the door.
Winston: All done! Though... tis not much help without the other Wizards.
Fenn: Where could I find them?
Winston: I believe I saw Randy headeth towards the kitchen, but tis all I knoweth. I am sorry.
Fenn starry: Well... to the kitchen!
Fenn: End of Demo! Thanks for playing Project Misfits <3
